    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***EXCELLENT POTENTIAL FOR FUTURE DEVELOPMENT SUBJECT TO FPP***\r\n***LARGE CORNER SITE***\r\n***GROUND WORKS COMPLETE TO ADD extra living accommodation extending to 35 sq m to the rear***\r\n\r\nPROPERTY PARTNERS O ‘ BRIEN SWAINE offer this 3 bedroom end of terrace property on an exceptionally large plot(extends to approx: 483 Sq m) in a mature cul de sac location. Boasting gas fired central heating, a newly built porch to the front and new internal doors downstairs this home is sure to impress.\r\n\r\nThe garden to the front side and rear is extensive and would be suitable for future development subject to FPP. An ideal family home in a very convenient location, viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nThe property is located a short walk from local shops and schools aswell as Liffey Valley Shopping Centre providing access to many shops , restaurants and recreational facilities. Access to the M50 and N4 is approximately 5 minutes away.\r\n\r\nClondalkin village is serviced with excellent facilities including local GP services, medical centre, sports and recreational clubs and many shopping outlets. There are also highly regarded primary and secondary schools including Colaiste Chilliain, Scoil Naomh Áine & Moyle Park College. Bordering Clondalkin to the west you will find the picturesque Corkagh Park which is one of Dublin’s largest parks covering over 290 acres where local residents enjoy many amenities such as a large playground, fishing lakes, pet farm, a dog park, cycling, running and a host of other sports.\r\n\r\nAccommodation includes: Porch, entrance hall, livingroom, kitchen, 3 bedrooms and bathroom"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch: 1.7m x 1.5m\r\nTiled floors, spotlights\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: 4.6m x 1.7m\r\nWood effect flooring, understairs storage, plumbed with gas boiler, storage cupboard off\r\n\r\nLivingroom: 3.3m x 4.6m\r\nWood effect flooring, feature fireplace solid fuel, TV point\r\n\r\nKitchen: 5.1m x 3.1m\r\nWall and floor mounted units, plumber with washing machine and stainless steel sink unit, integrated gas hob and oven\r\n\r\nLanding: 3.1m x 1.8m\r\nCarpet, access to attic, hotpress off\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 3.3m x 3.6m\r\nWood effect flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 4.18m x 2.8m\r\nCarpet\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 3.0m x 2.2m\r\nCarpet, built in wardrobes\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE\r\nFront – Fully walled and gated, extensive lawn area, driveway, side access to rear\r\nRear – Fully walled"
